        "Description": "March 14, 1995\r\rHello there, 47\r\rToday the targets are the brothers Arthur and Barry Jackson-Todd, who are the CEO and CFO of Jackson-Todd International Healthy Elite.\r\rA company that makes cures for cancer, tuberculosis and such.\r\rJackson-Todd brothers are meeting with Dean Paris, whose the CFO of MedSphere, a rival company, &amp; he is defecting to the Jackson-Todd brothers, and they will cure cancer, tuberculosis and other diseases.\r\rBut the catch is, they want to create new diseases for profit.",
